      "content": "1|**Port ale** is an indigo-hued extraplanar beverage best known for its ability to turn an ordinary tavern door into a route to [[The Loot Tavern]]. If a creature drinks port ale and steps through the door of a tavern within one minute, they are transported to the exterior of the drifting [[Astral Plane]] tavern.\n2|\n3|No one agrees on whether port ale is a drink, a spell, a potion, or a logistical crime. It tastes different to everyone, though most describe it as “strong,” “purple,” and “probably not approved by local authorities.”\n4|\n5|Bottles of port ale sometimes arrive by invitation from [[Heliana]], appear in the hands of suspicious merchants, or circulate among adventurers as emergency exits. In [[Stickyickistan]], possessing a bottle usually means someone is either about to visit [[The Loot Tavern]] or run away from something loudly.\n6|\n7|Port Ale costs 5 gp.",
